<urn:anqr:experience-profile-revision:1> <urn:usf:predicate:nonClaim> "No Foundation service is required by this journey. Generation, preview and export are ANQR-local capabilities realised with no third-party runtime dependency, and the four Foundation capabilities ANQR marks product-mediated are internationalisation, branding, search and policy decisions, none of which supplies them. A Foundation binding is therefore absent rather than omitted." <urn:anqr:graph:experience> .
<urn:anqr:experience-profile-revision:1> <urn:usf:predicate:nonClaim> "One rendered surface establishes no parity. Surface parity and locale parity stay undecidable, and no second cosmetic surface or string table was created to make them look decided." <urn:anqr:graph:experience> .
<urn:anqr:experience-profile-revision:1> <urn:usf:predicate:nonClaim> "This revision covers one journey. It is not the ANQR experience; it is the first slice of it, built so the boundaries can be inspected before they become the template for the rest." <urn:anqr:graph:experience> .
<urn:anqr:experience-profile-revision:1> <urn:usf:predicate:objective> "The first ANQR experience: someone with no account states what a code should carry, sees the real artefact as they type, and takes it away in a form they chose." <urn:anqr:graph:experience> .
